cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pi-fold, cite it as below. To cite the first measurement, use the preferred citation."
title: "pi-fold"
abstract: "Lossless context folding for Pi. Finished spans of a session transcript collapse in place into short briefs; the exact originals stay on disk, addressed and verified by SHA-256, and peek and expand return them byte for byte. Folding is automatic and needs no agent participation."
type: software
authors:
